description_json:
{"type":"/type/text","value":"Join Alice on her magical journeys in Wonderland and through the Looking-Glass

The two timeless stories about Alice and her extraordinary adventures are collected together here in one volume. Meet the Mad Hatter, the White Rabbit Humpty Dumpty, the Cheshire Cat and y Others as Alice explores these wonderful worlds where nothing is in the least bit ordinary.
--back cover"}

